WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:05.220
In the near future, Doc Terror, and his cyborg companion, Hacker,

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.720
unleash their forces to conquer Earth.

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:11.600
Only one force can stop this evil:

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:13.590
a handful of brave men.

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.960
In specially created exo-frames,

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:18.750
they can be transported anywhere

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:21.750
to fuse with incredible assault weapon systems,

00:00:21.750 --> 00:00:25.030
beamed down from the space station Sky Vault,

00:00:25.030 --> 00:00:26.460
becoming

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.130
Man and Machine:

00:00:28.130 --> 00:00:29.980
Power Extreme.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:35.700
Max Ray, brilliant sea operations commander.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:41.810
Jake Rockwell, rugged land operations specialist.

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:48.650
Ace McLeod, daring air operations expert.

00:00:48.650 --> 00:00:54.520
Whatever the challenge, they are ready.

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:57.170
The Centurions!

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:11.170
exploring uncharted depths in the sea bubble, Meili and Jason of Sea Lab suddenly vanish.

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:15.670
Max Ray descends in Depth Charger to search for them and encounters an incredible monster

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:21.570
squid. Escaping from the creature creates its own peril as Max is caught in an underwater

00:01:21.570 --> 00:01:25.540
avalanche and swept into a mysterious deep sea trench.

00:01:25.540 --> 00:01:30.000
Meanwhile, Ace and Jake commission the new Venus space probe in an effort to rescue.

00:01:30.030 --> 00:01:36.980
you max but the mission includes ace's former academy buddy sean o'connor who still has a score

00:01:36.980 --> 00:01:44.330
to settle with mcleod max awakens to find himself in a strange new world hidden in a secret cavern

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:51.810
at the bottom of the ocean a sunken city of atlantis ruled by the beautiful princess diana who wants to

00:01:51.810 --> 00:02:00.000
prevent all contact with the upper world but her ambitious cousin naro has his own ideas he leads his forces in

00:02:00.920 --> 00:02:09.510
After the space probe, using Orbit Litter's scepter, Ace puts up a good fight, but succumbs to the terrible grip of the monster squid.

00:02:09.510 --> 00:02:13.180
And now, the story continues.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:29.670
What's up, Crystal? Emergency!

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:32.040
I hope she's receiving.

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:51.790
Crystal, I tried to call, but I was, uh, tied up.

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:54.750
Jake said you needed help.

00:02:55.490 --> 00:02:57.530
Me? Nah, I was doing okay.

00:02:58.230 --> 00:02:58.450
Woo!

00:03:01.690 --> 00:03:08.900
I lost contact with Jake. What's going on down there?

00:03:08.900 --> 00:03:12.780
You won't believe it.

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:21.930
Think it's time we left this party, folks.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:28.770
Nice that they gave me my own clothes back.

00:03:35.310 --> 00:03:40.470
Interesting place you have here, Naro. I suppose you invited us here for a reason.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:43.090
Of course, Top-Sider.

00:03:43.090 --> 00:03:47.430
With your captured vessel, I will conquer your sea lab.

00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:52.310
Then I will use its weapons to take control of Atlantis.

00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:55.000
Don't count on it, Fishbrain.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:59.540
Perhaps your companion is a more reasonable man.

00:04:01.370 --> 00:04:03.720
Depends. On what it's worth to ya.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:06.290
O'Connor! What are you?

00:04:06.290 --> 00:04:09.190
I know, hero. How much?

00:04:09.190 --> 00:04:13.200
Ah, a reasonable man, I see.

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:15.330
You traitor!

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:19.470
Sorry, Jake. Got to look out for old number one, you know.

00:04:19.470 --> 00:04:24.630
Okay, Naro. Let's talk deal.

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:30.000
The trench is like a secret tunnel opening under the sea bottom. It's the only

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:35.570
way to get there the new forcefield just installed on sea lab should allow it to

00:04:35.570 --> 00:04:49.140
dive deep enough then beam me back and let's get the show in the water wait I'll go first

00:05:01.120 --> 00:05:02.120
Are you all right?

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:02.970
Max!

00:05:02.970 --> 00:05:04.870
Come on down!

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:07.590
The water is fine!

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:12.570
Phew!

00:05:12.570 --> 00:05:14.460
It stinks in here!

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:17.560
I thought you said the water was fine!

00:05:17.560 --> 00:05:19.520
So I exaggerated a little.

00:05:19.520 --> 00:05:22.900
This must be how they get rid of their garbage.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:24.850
At least it's a way out.

00:05:24.850 --> 00:05:28.900
We need to find a communications room so I can call Sky Vault.

00:05:38.640 --> 00:05:40.570
Right there, Commander!

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:51.530
Let's move it!

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:55.180
I don't think I like it!

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:57.780
Over there! Quickly!

00:06:02.490 --> 00:06:05.160
Those fish must clean up all the garbage!

00:06:06.150 --> 00:06:11.240
There's a door, come on!

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:15.160
It is time to go!

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:18.880
Remember, you promised not to harm Jake if I helped ya.

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:21.410
You can trust Nauru.

00:06:31.310 --> 00:06:33.310
That looks like the place to start.

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:37.780
Bingo.

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:39.540
Nobody home.

00:06:39.540 --> 00:06:43.500
Now if I can contact Sky Vault.

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.500
Max Ray calling Sky Vault.

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.480
Calling...

00:06:47.480 --> 00:06:49.080
Bo...

00:06:49.080 --> 00:06:50.920
Dope.

00:06:50.920 --> 00:06:52.000
Max?

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.000
I can barely hear you.

00:06:53.000 --> 00:06:55.080
Come in, Max. Do you copy?

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:57.060
I copy, Crystal.

00:06:57.060 --> 00:06:59.350
Stand by for your news.

00:06:59.350 --> 00:07:00.000
Stop!

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:03.430
Sorry, Princess. I have to do this.

00:07:03.430 --> 00:07:06.040
And I have to do this, Max Ray.

00:07:06.040 --> 00:07:08.260
Stop him!

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.720
What are you gonna do with us?

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:35.720
Put you someplace where you can't escape so easily.

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:43.590
Coming up on the trench, Ace.

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:46.240
I only hope we're in time.

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:52.410
Okay, Top Sider, out!

00:07:52.410 --> 00:07:58.860
Now what?

00:08:01.370 --> 00:08:05.260
Why, it's lunch time, Top Sider.

00:08:05.260 --> 00:08:09.740
I'm not hungry.

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:10.920
That's okay.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:12.480
You're not eating lunch.

00:08:12.480 --> 00:08:19.120
You're going to be lunch.

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:22.610
Start a fight with Jason.

00:08:22.610 --> 00:08:23.390
What?

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:25.850
I need a diversion.

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:28.610
Ah, got you.

00:08:30.830 --> 00:08:34.680
Ace, we've picked up a signal from the space probe.

00:08:34.680 --> 00:08:36.350
Jake!

00:08:36.350 --> 00:08:38.220
No, it's Sean O'Connor.

00:08:38.220 --> 00:08:40.890
We're going to hold here and wait for their arrival.

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:41.950
Good.

00:08:41.950 --> 00:08:44.570
I knew they'd get away.

00:08:44.570 --> 00:08:46.950
This is all your fault, Jason.

00:08:46.950 --> 00:08:48.570
My fault?

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:52.000
If they hadn't given me such a useless tech.

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:55.310
Who are you calling useless?

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:56.340
Guard, stop.

00:09:02.460 --> 00:09:07.940
Sorry, princess. This is my dance.

00:09:07.940 --> 00:09:10.240
You can't get away with this.

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:12.370
You underestimate Top-Siders.

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:25.420
And to make certain, you're coming with us, Top-Sider.

00:09:25.420 --> 00:09:29.030
This is it.

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:33.590
We're gonna throw him in, too?

00:09:33.590 --> 00:09:34.660
Huh?

00:09:34.660 --> 00:09:37.720
Who?

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:43.850
Didn't think you'd know that one down here!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:47.830
This is a bit old-fashioned, but it should be adequate transportation.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:51.730
Now, Princess, you're going to show us the way home.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:04.670
Attention! Halter be destroyed!

00:10:04.670 --> 00:10:09.030
Better call them off, Princess.

00:10:09.030 --> 00:10:13.200
This is Princess Diana. Allow us to proceed.

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:16.190
Those orders were no one leaves.

00:10:16.190 --> 00:10:23.700
Ball vessels! Fire!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:30.000
You've got trouble in paradise. Hang on, everybody.

00:10:47.500 --> 00:10:49.750
I'd say it, but I'm glad to see you!

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.010
Where's Jake?

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:52.150
What?!

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:57.610
A friend couldn't make it.

00:10:57.610 --> 00:11:00.000
Sorry, Ace. I had to do it.

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:03.970
I don't recognize the face, but the style is familiar.

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:09.790
I am Prince Naro of Atlantis, and soon to be your master.

00:11:12.820 --> 00:11:15.540
See if you can find some weaponry on this thing, Jason.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.180
I think this might do it.

00:11:17.720 --> 00:11:19.320
Yeah, that's it!

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:23.840
Okay, now let's show these boys how to play this game.

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:44.310
"We have their commander in the main control center. I am master of this vessel. My cousin Diana will certainly be surprised to see me."

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:14.130
nice shot jason we aim to please i don't understand why my men are attacking me wait

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:21.700
naro my cousin he is too ambitious for his own good maybe we should declare a truce princess

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:30.000
we can help each other yes perhaps you're right this is jake rockwell calling sky vault come in

00:12:31.210 --> 00:12:33.410
Jake, are you all right? Where are you?

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:35.550
Don't rightly know.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:39.960
But I do know that C-Lab is about to have some big trouble.

00:12:40.530 --> 00:12:42.510
Ace is on C-Lab. I'll warn him.

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:49.960
Better get that wrist calm so he can't call for help.

00:12:49.960 --> 00:12:56.800
Need the Centurion anymore?

00:12:57.270 --> 00:12:59.800
Take him out and get rid of him.

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:03.200
Why don't you let me take care of that personally?

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:06.400
Ace and I have an old score to settle.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:09.980
Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha! Why not?

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:16.970
And when he does, you finish him.

00:13:16.970 --> 00:13:21.790
Connor's usefulness is at an end.

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:27.360
No use, Jake. Ace isn't answering.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:29.730
Naro must already be there.

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:32.040
Beam me to sea lab, Crystal!

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:33.900
I can't, Jake.

00:13:33.900 --> 00:13:39.010
They've raised the anti-pressure force field. We can't beam through it.

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:40.880
Maybe you can't get me inside,

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:42.840
but you can beam me outside!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:47.270
Your Centurion land, not sea, remember?

00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:49.560
So what?

00:13:49.560 --> 00:13:51.470
I can borrow Death Charger.

00:13:51.470 --> 00:13:53.440
Hmm. Maybe.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:56.440
Your ExoFrame will accept Max's assault weapon system.

00:13:56.440 --> 00:13:59.540
Question is, can you handle it?

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:02.400
I can handle it, beam it.

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:05.570
Energize!

00:14:21.030 --> 00:14:28.430
Thought it would come to this, Sean.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:30.000
That's the brakes, Amy.

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:32.210
Let me borrow that.

00:14:32.210 --> 00:14:37.410
Any last words, Ace McCloud?

00:14:37.410 --> 00:14:40.330
I take back what I said about that girl.

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:43.280
I'm glad she chose me.

00:15:00.440 --> 00:15:03.460
You didn't think I was serious about all this, did ya?

00:15:03.460 --> 00:15:05.630
It did cross my mind.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:09.040
I had to convince Naro I was on his side.

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:10.520
You'll need this, too.

00:15:10.520 --> 00:15:12.800
It won't do us much good.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:15.310
Crystal can't beam through the force field.

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:21.050
We'll have to shut it down momentarily and hope the deep-sea pressure doesn't crush Sea Lab like an eggshell.

00:15:21.050 --> 00:15:23.830
The radio here won't reach Sky Vault.

00:15:23.830 --> 00:15:25.160
Try this.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.310
Thanks, Princess.

00:15:27.310 --> 00:15:30.000
Max Ray to Crystal Kane.

00:15:32.520 --> 00:15:34.520
Axe, am I glad to see you.

00:15:35.820 --> 00:15:40.020
We're coming out of the trench, approaching C-Lab, but we can't make contact.

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:43.440
Someone named Naro has taken over C-Lab.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.330
We can't beam inside because of the force field.

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:48.210
Then beam the outside.

00:15:48.440 --> 00:15:50.140
Properly dressed, of course.

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:52.140
Will a tidal blast do?

00:15:52.470 --> 00:15:53.970
Jake's got depth charger.

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:57.080
Jake, how's he doing in my territory?

00:15:57.740 --> 00:15:59.220
See for yourself.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:01.540
Energize.

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:02.160
Skybolt here. That you, Ace?

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:04.930
The force field is down on C-Lab.

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:08.230
Send me Orbital Interceptor with the firepower from Skybolt.

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:10.180
You got it, Ace.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:15.740
See when you are, beautiful.

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:21.480
Great!

00:17:31.440 --> 00:17:33.580
has temporarily lowered the force field, Jake.

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.460
I'll beam you and Wild Weasel

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:36.990
on board. Thanks.

00:17:37.430 --> 00:17:39.150
This wet stuff isn't for me.

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:43.150
Give me the freeze ray

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:44.590
cannons from Detonator.

00:17:45.310 --> 00:17:45.770
Will do.

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:50.420
Extreme fire!

00:18:04.830 --> 00:18:06.850
This is of our own, as you might recall.

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:17.700
What is happening?

00:18:18.160 --> 00:18:18.760
Retard!

00:18:20.820 --> 00:18:29.410
What about you, Ace?

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:03.880
This show is just about wrapped up, Ace.

00:19:03.880 --> 00:19:07.880
I think you're right. Let's go see what's happening inside C-Lab.

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:12.960
Prince Naro! We are being defeated!

00:19:12.960 --> 00:19:16.960
Besides the Centurions, Diana's Squid has joined the attack!

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:21.330
We must prepare our escape! Come!

